    "created_at": "2023-01-09T14:45:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-09T14:45:14Z",
    "body": "This is because time module is disabled by default (since you are using a non-existent config). If you set your `starship_transient_rprompt_func` to display a module which is on by default, like directory, it will work as expected.\r\n\r\n```fish\r\nfunction starship_transient_rprompt_func\r\n    starship module directory\r\nend\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
